name: Compact actual finding reading, resize recovery and no-color restart without model work
size: 120x36
cwd: @TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR
env: HOME=/private/tmp/kuzushi-live-owned-investigation-20261010/home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TARGET
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 30 Viewing Review | review-list
require-live-snap: 30 FINDINGS · 1 | settled-list
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Owned public documentation example | selected-detail
resize: 160x48
live-snap: detail-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: detail-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: detail-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: detail-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: compact-detail-first
expect: F-0001
expect: sources:3
expect: PgUp/PgDn
expect: q review list
expect: REVIEW · NAVIGATE · Esc prompt
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-detail-page-1
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-detail-page-2
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-detail-page-3
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-detail-page-4
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-detail-page-5
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-detail-page-6
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-detail-page-7
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-detail-page-8
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-detail-page-9
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-detail-page-10
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-detail-page-11
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-detail-page-12
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-detail-page-13
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-detail-page-14
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-detail-page-15
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-detail-page-16
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-detail-page-17
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-detail-page-18
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-detail-page-19
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-detail-tail
ask: Does compact Review give at least six readable detail rows, with the same finding, complete source/decision/provenance and paging/back controls?
resize: 120x36
live-snap: restored-detail
expect: F-0001
resize: 40x12
live-snap: restored-compact-detail
keys: q
require-live-snap: 25 FINDINGS | compact-list
ask: Does returning from the detail preserve the selected finding and let the operator read the list without another action or request?
resize: 120x36
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_investigation.py @TARGET @ART reading
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=/private/tmp/kuzushi-live-owned-investigation-20261010/home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TARGET
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 30 FINDINGS · 1 | restarted-list
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Owned public documentation example | restarted-detail
resize: 40x12
live-snap: restarted-compact-detail
expect: sources:3
expect: PgUp/PgDn
expect: REVIEW · NAVIGATE · Esc prompt
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_investigation.py @TARGET @ART reading
ask: Does no-color restart retain the original human decision, source commit and four-call ledger while compact controls remain readable?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
